          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We will follow you, Kalenz — but where can we go?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We must reach the Elvish Council in Ka’lian and enlist their help to recapture our home."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We are surrounded!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Then we must storm one of the orcs’ outposts to break the encirclement before more enemies arrive!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Very well, Kalenz — lead us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to_unit",
            id: "Kalenz",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "attack",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_defender_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_side%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22has_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Velon%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_king_is_dead.ogg",
            play_once: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We surrender!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Did I mention that we take no prisoners? Die!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Kalenz was right and I was wrong. Go; join Kalenz while yet you can. I and the remaining elders will cover your retreat as best we may."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Flee, Kalenz... find vengeance for us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Velon, I swear on the life of Irdya that I will not let you be forgotten while elves yet draw breath to sing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Swords will aid us more than songs, Kalenz; you saw that before I."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Swordsmen you shall have, as swiftly as I can find them and return."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Velon has fallen. He counseled weakness, but did not deserve such an ugly death. We shall return with swords to avenge him!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You won’t get very far! After them!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Velon",
          },
        ],
      },
